Hello, world!

I'm Matt (aka smallwat3r), a passionate Software Engineer. I love Emacs,
have a mild addiction to ergonomic split keyboards, and enjoy hacking and
crafting new things.

You'll often find me behind a cup of coffee, or geeking out over craft beer.
I also believe that if you have a cat, you're probably a good person.

I write about keyboards, code, and other things on my [blog](index.html).

